{"id": "5718a8fd-985b-40b3-8aa7-cd3eed5d228b", "slug": "spectral-dynamics-dispersion-matrix", "title": "Spectral Dynamics - Dispersion Matrix", "description": "Spectral Dynamics Onboarding Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Spectral Dynamics - Dispersion Matrix\"\ndescription: \"Spectral Dynamics Onboarding Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#F2EAD3\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#F2EAD3\"\n  background: \"#030305\"\n  surface: \"#F2EAD3\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Playfair Display\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Spectral Dynamics - Dispersion Matrix\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 222; favorites: 19; remixes: 5.\nTags: onboarding, animated, webgl, threejs, bento, dither, charts, flow.\n## Overview\nSpectral Dynamics Onboarding Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nCHROMATIC DISPERSION_SYS Spectral Mechanics. Calibrating photonic telemetry. Monitor light wavelength dispersion in real-time. Adjust spectral fidelity to observe raw photonic data synthesize into coherent chromatic pat…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Spectral Mechanics. Calibrating photonic telemetry..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #F2EAD3, secondary #000000, accent #F2EAD3, background #030305, surface #F2EAD3, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Playfair Display for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Spectral Dynamics - Dispersion Matrix</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                        serif: ['\"Playfair Display\"', 'serif'],\n                        mono: ['ui-monospace', 'SFMono-Regular', 'Menlo', 'Monaco', 'Consolas', '\"Liberation Mono\"', '\"Courier New\"', 'monospace'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        brand: {\n                            dark: '#030305',\n                            surface: '#F2EAD3',\n                            accent: '#F2EAD3'\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n    <link id=\"all-fonts-link-font-geist\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@200;300;400;500;600&display=swap\">\n    <style id=\"all-fonts-style-font-geist\">.font-geist { font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif !important; }</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#030305] min-h-screen w-full overflow-hidden font-sans antialiased text-white relative selection:bg-[#F2EAD3] selection:text-black flex flex-col touch-none\">\n\n    <!-- Edge-to-edge Background Layers -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 bg-[#000000]\">\n        <!-- WebGL Canvas Background -->\n        <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none block\"></canvas>\n\n        <!-- Depth Grid: Diagonal hairline grid -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none z-10 mix-blend-screen opacity-20\" style=\"background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, transparent 8px, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 8px, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 9px);\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Grain Texture Overlay -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none z-20 mix-blend-overlay opacity-[0.08]\" style=\"background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=%220 0 200 200%22 xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%3E%3Cfilter id=%22noiseFilter%22%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=%22fractalNoise%22 baseFrequency=%220.8%22 numOctaves=%223%22 stitchTiles=%22stitch%22/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=%22100%25%22 height=%22100%25%22 filter=%22url(%23noiseFilter)%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E');\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Requested DOM Fallback / Atmospheric Gradient -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none z-30\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to top, #000000 5%, transparent 60%);\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Deep Gradient overlay for text readability -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none z-40\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.6) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.1) 30%, rgba(0,0,0,0.95) 100%);\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Full-screen Content Composition -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-50 flex flex-col justify-between w-full h-[100dvh] p-4 sm:p-6 lg:p-8 max-w-[1440px] mx-auto\">\n        <!-- Inner Framed Grid Layout -->\n        <div class=\"relative w-full h-full flex flex-col justify-between p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-12 border border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-br from-white/[0.02] to-transparent via-transparent\">\n\n            <!-- Corner Brackets -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-4 h-4 border-t border-l border-white/30 -translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-4 h-4 border-t border-r border-white/30 translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-4 h-4 border-b border-l border-white/30 -translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-4 h-4 border-b border-r border-white/30 translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Top Metadata -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between w-full fade-in-el\">\n                <div class=\"inline-block bg-transparent text-[#F2EAD3] border border-[#F2EAD3]/30 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.1em] font-light shadow-lg backdrop-blur-sm font-geist\">\n                    CHROMATIC DISPERSION_SYS\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Content / Typography / Slider -->\n            <div class=\"w-full mt-auto flex flex-col gap-10 lg:gap-14\">\n\n                <div class=\"w-full flex flex-col xl:flex-row xl:items-end justify-between gap-10 xl:gap-16\">\n                    <!-- Headline & Supporting Line -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6 w-full\">\n                        <h1 id=\"hero-title\" class=\"text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-7xl leading-none text-white mix-blend-plus-lighter w-full tracking-tighter font-geist font-thin\">\n                            Spectral Mechanics.<br>Calibrating photonic telemetry.\n                        </h1>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-6 mt-2 fade-in-el\">\n                            <p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed max-w-lg border-l border-white/20 pl-5 drop-shadow-md font-light font-geist\">\n                                Monitor light wavelength dispersion in real-time. Adjust spectral fidelity to observe raw photonic data synthesize into coherent chromatic patterns.\n                            </p>\n\n                            <a href=\"#\" class=\"shrink-0 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-[#F2EAD3] text-black px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full text-sm font-light transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-105 group/btn font-geist\">\n                                Initialize Scan\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:box-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-xl group-hover/btn:rotate-12 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Micro-callouts / Chips (3D Gradient Border Shell) -->\n                    <div class=\"fade-in-el shrink-0 self-start xl:self-end mt-4 xl:mt-0 3d-card-wrapper z-20\" style=\"perspective: 1500px;\">\n                        <div class=\"3d-card shadow-2xl relative z-10 group\" style=\"display:inline-block; padding:1px; border-radius:24px; background:linear-gradient(to right bottom, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)); transform-style: preserve-3d;\">\n                            <div style=\"padding:24px 32px; border-radius:23px; background:#171717; box-shadow:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02) 0px 0px 40px 0px inset;\" class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 relative overflow-hidden h-full w-full\">\n                                <!-- Noise overlay -->\n                                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.15] mix-blend-overlay pointer-events-none\" style=\"background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=%220 0 200 200%22 xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%3E%3Cfilter id=%22noiseFilter%22%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=%22fractalNoise%22 baseFrequency=%220.65%22 numOctaves=%223%22 stitchTiles=%22stitch%22/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=%22100%25%22 height=%22100%25%22 filter=%22url(%23noiseFilter)%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E');\"></div>\n\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-white/50 font-light relative z-10 font-geist\">Optical processing arrays</span>\n                                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 text-white/80 relative z-10\">\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 hover:text-[#F2EAD3] transition-colors cursor-pointer group/item\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:sim-card-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-[#F2EAD3] group-hover/item:scale-110 transition-transform\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                        <span class=\"text-sm tracking-tight font-light font-geist\">Prism Core</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 hover:text-[#F2EAD3] transition-colors cursor-pointer group/item\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:wireless-charge-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-[#F2EAD3] group-hover/item:scale-110 transition-transform\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                        <span class=\"text-sm tracking-tight font-light font-geist\">Refraction Engine</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 hover:text-[#F2EAD3] transition-colors cursor-pointer group/item\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:infinity-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-[#F2EAD3] group-hover/item:scale-110 transition-transform\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                        <span class=\"text-sm tracking-tight font-light font-geist\">Lumen Matrix</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Interactive Slider Area -->\n                <div class=\"w-full pb-2 fade-in-el\">\n                    <!-- Custom Slider Element -->\n                    <div id=\"fidelity-slider\" class=\"relative h-6 w-full cursor-pointer flex items-center group/slider touch-none\">\n                        <!-- Background Track -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute left-0 right-0 h-[1px] bg-[#F2EAD3]/20 transition-colors group-hover/slider:bg-[#F2EAD3]/40\"></div>\n                        <!-- Active Track -->\n                        <div id=\"slider-fill\" class=\"absolute left-0 h-[1px] bg-[#F2EAD3] w-1/2 transition-colors\"></div>\n                        <!-- Thumb -->\n                        <div id=\"slider-thumb\" class=\"absolute left-1/2 w-4 h-4 bg-[#F2EAD3] rounded-full -translate-x-1/2 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(242,234,211,0.4)] hover:scale-125 transition-transform duration-200 z-10\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Invisible Hit Area -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-y-[-15px] inset-x-0 bg-transparent\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Labels -->\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between w-full mt-5 relative\">\n                        <span class=\"slider-label text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider sm:tracking-[0.1em] text-white/40 transition-colors duration-300 font-geist font-light\">WAVELENGTH</span>\n                        <span class=\"slider-label text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider sm:tracking-[0.1em] text-white/40 transition-colors duration-300 font-geist font-light\">DISPERSION</span>\n                        <span class=\"slider-label text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider sm:tracking-[0.1em] text-[#F2EAD3] font-light transition-colors duration-300 relative font-geist\">\n                            SPECTRUM\n                            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#F2EAD3] rounded-full opacity-100 transition-opacity\"></div>\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"slider-label text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider sm:tracking-[0.1em] text-white/40 transition-colors duration-300 font-geist font-light\">REFRACTION</span>\n                        <span class=\"slider-label text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider sm:tracking-[0.1em] text-white/40 transition-colors duration-300 font-geist font-light\">LUMINANCE</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- WebGL Three.js Chromatic Dispersion Setup ---\n        const initThreeJS = () => {\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n            if (!canvas || typeof THREE === 'undefined') return;\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: true, antialias: false });\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n            const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1, 1, 1, -1, 0, 1);\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(2, 2);\n\n            const fragmentShader = `\n                uniform float u_time;\n                uniform vec2 u_resolution;\n                uniform float u_fidelity;\n\n                void main() {\n                    vec2 uv = gl_FragCoord.xy / u_resolution.xy;\n                    vec2 p = uv * 2.0 - 1.0;\n                    p.x *= u_resolution.x / u_resolution.y;\n\n                    // Base rotation for diagonal light sweeps\n                    float angle = 0.55;\n                    float s = sin(angle);\n                    float c = cos(angle);\n                    p = mat2(c, -s, s, c) * p;\n\n                    float t = u_time * 0.2;\n\n                    // Organic warp of the lines\n                    p.y += sin(p.x * 2.5 - t * 1.5) * 0.12;\n                    p.y += cos(p.x * 1.2 + t * 0.8) * 0.15;\n\n                    vec3 finalColor = vec3(0.0);\n\n                    // Chromatic aberration spread modulated by slider\n                    float spread = 0.06 * (0.3 + u_fidelity * 0.7);\n\n                    // Calculate 3 shifted waves for RGB\n                    for(int i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\n                        // Offsets: R is top (+), G is mid (0), B is bottom (-)\n                        float offset = (float(1 - i)) * spread;\n                        float y = p.y + offset;\n\n                        // Construct complex overlapping bands\n                        float wave1 = sin(y * 6.0 + t * 2.0) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n                        float wave2 = sin(y * 12.0 - t * 1.2) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n                        float combined = wave1 * wave2;\n\n                        // Sharpen core, add soft glow\n                        float intensity = smoothstep(0.85, 0.99, combined) * 1.2;\n                        intensity += smoothstep(0.4, 0.9, combined) * 0.35;\n\n                        if(i == 0) finalColor.r += intensity;\n                        if(i == 1) finalColor.g += intensity;\n                        if(i == 2) finalColor.b += intensity;\n                    }\n\n                    // Color correction to match reference (boost blue/orange contrast)\n                    finalColor.r *= 1.15; // Enhance reds for orange top edge\n                    finalColor.g *= 0.95;\n                    finalColor.b *= 1.4;  // Enhance blues for cyan bottom edge\n\n                    gl_FragColor = vec4(finalColor, 1.0);\n                }\n            `;\n\n            const uniforms = {\n                u_time: { value: 0.0 },\n                u_resolution: { value: new THREE.Vector2() },\n                u_fidelity: { value: 0.5 }\n            };\n\n            const material = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n                vertexShader: `\n                    void main() {\n                        gl_Position = vec4(position, 1.0);\n                    }\n                `,\n                fragmentShader,\n                uniforms,\n                depthWrite: false,\n                depthTest: false\n            });\n\n            const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n            scene.add(mesh);\n\n            const resize = () => {\n                const width = window.innerWidth;\n                const height = window.innerHeight;\n                renderer.setSize(width, height);\n                uniforms.u_resolution.value.set(width, height);\n            };\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n            resize();\n\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n            const render = () => {\n                uniforms.u_time.value = clock.getElapsedTime();\n                uniforms.u_fidelity.value = window.sliderFidelity !== undefined ? window.sliderFidelity : 0.5;\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n                requestAnimationFrame(render);\n            };\n            requestAnimationFrame(render);\n        };\n\n        // --- Application Interactions Setup ---\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            initThreeJS();\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // 1. Masked Word Reveal Animation\n            const titleElement = document.getElementById('hero-title');\n            const htmlContent = titleElement.innerHTML;\n            titleElement.innerHTML = '';\n\n            const parts = htmlContent.split(/<br\\s*\\/?>/i);\n\n            parts.forEach((part, index) => {\n                const words = part.trim().split(/\\s+/);\n                words.forEach(word => {\n                    if (!word) return;\n                    const wrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                    wrapper.className = 'inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom mr-[0.25em] mb-[0.05em] pt-[0.1em]';\n                    const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                    inner.className = 'inline-block transform translate-y-[110%] opacity-0';\n                    inner.innerHTML = word;\n                    wrapper.appendChild(inner);\n                    titleElement.appendChild(wrapper);\n                    titleElement.appendChild(document.createTextNode(' '));\n                });\n\n                if (index < parts.length - 1) {\n                    titleElement.appendChild(document.createElement('br'));\n                }\n            });\n\n            gsap.to('#hero-title span span', {\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1.2,\n                stagger: 0.04,\n                ease: 'power4.out',\n                delay: 0.3\n            });\n\n            // 2. Sequential Fade-Ins\n            gsap.from('.fade-in-el', {\n                y: 15,\n                opacity: 0,\n                duration: 1,\n                stagger: 0.15,\n                ease: \"power3.out\",\n                delay: 0.8\n            });\n\n            // 3. Floating 3D Card Animation\n            gsap.to('.3d-card', {\n                y: -6,\n                rotationX: 2.5,\n                rotationY: -2.5,\n                duration: 4,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n                yoyo: true,\n                repeat: -1,\n                transformOrigin: \"center center\"\n            });\n\n            // 4. Custom Slider Logic mapped to WebGL Data Uniform\n            const slider = document.getElementById('fidelity-slider');\n            const thumb = document.getElementById('slider-thumb');\n            const fill = document.getElementById('slider-fill');\n            const labels = document.querySelectorAll('.slider-label');\n\n            let isDragging = false;\n            let currentPercent = 0.5;\n\n            function updateUI(percent) {\n                percent = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, percent));\n\n                thumb.style.left = `${percent * 100}%`;\n                fill.style.width = `${percent * 100}%`;\n\n                const numLabels = labels.length;\n                const step = 1 / (numLabels - 1);\n                const activeIndex = Math.round(percent / step);\n\n                labels.forEach((label, idx) => {\n                    const dot = label.querySelector('div');\n                    if (idx === activeIndex) {\n                        label.classList.remove('text-white/40');\n                        label.classList.add('text-[#F2EAD3]', 'font-light');\n                        if(!dot) {\n                            label.innerHTML += `<div class=\"absolute -bottom-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#F2EAD3] rounded-full opacity-100 transition-opacity\"></div>`;\n                        }\n                    } else {\n                        label.classList.add('text-white/40');\n                        label.classList.remove('text-[#F2EAD3]', 'font-light');\n                        if(dot) dot.remove();\n                    }\n                });\n\n                // Export percent to global context for the WebGL Shader\n                window.sliderFidelity = percent;\n            }\n\n            function handleMove(clientX) {\n                if (!isDragging) return;\n                const rect = slider.getBoundingClientRect();\n                let x = clientX - rect.left;\n                let percent = x / rect.width;\n                updateUI(percent);\n            }\n\n            slider.addEventListener('mousedown', (e) => {\n                isDragging = true;\n                handleMove(e.clientX);\n            });\n\n            window.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                if (isDragging) handleMove(e.clientX);\n            });\n\n            window.addEventListener('mouseup', () => {\n                isDragging = false;\n            });\n\n            slider.addEventListener('touchstart', (e) => {\n                isDragging = true;\n                handleMove(e.touches[0].clientX);\n            }, { passive: true });\n\n            window.addEventListener('touchmove', (e) => {\n                if (isDragging) handleMove(e.touches[0].clientX);\n            }, { passive: true });\n\n            window.addEventListener('touchend', () => {\n                isDragging = false;\n            });\n\n            updateUI(currentPercent);\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "spectral-dynamics-dispersion-matrix.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/spectral-dynamics-dispersion-matrix.jpg", "source_name": "spectral-dynamics-dispersion-matrix-DESIGN.md", "views": 411, "forks": 13, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T06:07:23.075876+00:00"}